<title>DENMARK: Denmark sees fiscal tightening in 1997.</title>
<headline>Denmark sees fiscal tightening in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Danish Finance Ministry on Tuesday said it expected 1997 fiscal tightening equal to 0.4 percent of gross domestic product.</p>
</text>
